 * One-off script: translate demo SysML examples (under prisma/examples/)
 * to Turkish identifiers and write them to prisma/examples-tr/.
 *
 * - Standard Libraries/ is excluded (OMG official library — never translate).
 * - Folder names, file names (without .sysml extension), and identifiers
 *   inside files are translated using IDENT_MAP + FOLDER_MAP + FILE_MAP.
 * - SysML keywords, primitive types, and OMG library namespaces are preserved.
 *
 * Run:  npx tsx scripts/translate-examples.mts
 */

